{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわぁ〜(*´ω｀*).♪\nRottyです."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4／23に 愛しのまあやが 16歳になりました!!\nパチパチパチパ...チ。\nまあやお誕生日おめでとうね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは最近になって\n何でか分からないんですけど 私の事を「Rony」って言ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あえて 本人に何もつっこまんかったけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/04/24/4490859/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑\nまあやが 「ろに− ろに−」言ってくるの可愛いから...*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、そしてそしてバナナマン設楽さんも同じ日に誕生日を迎えましたね!!!\n皆でお仕事が終わってから 恒例のハッピーバースデーを歌って集合写真をとって 設楽さんのケーキをメンバーが一瞬で食べました^^笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"設楽さん お誕生日おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/04/24/4490859/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/04/24/4490859/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"設楽さん日村さんのコンビはすごくお似合いですし、トークも面白いですし、CMは最高です。心がなごみます(*´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつも乃木どこでお世話になってます.\n大したこと できない私ですが、これからもよろしくお願い致します＼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/04/24/4490859/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/04/24/4490859/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日お疲れ様です..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/04/24/4490859/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のし..*"}],"source":"archive"}